<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n14087" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποτοξεύω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>shoot off arrows,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπὸ δένδρων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.C.
					37.2
				</span></i>
			: metaph., <i>shoot off like an arrow,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥηματίσκια</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Tht.</u>
					180a
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Rh.Pr.</u>
				17
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Prom.Es</u>
				2
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>shoot</i> a person, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινά τινι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Vit.Auct.</u>
					24
				</span></i>
			 (codd., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατατοξ-</span> Cobet).
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>keep off by shooting,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λοιμόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Alex.</u>
					36
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
    <div class="alpheios-lex-alph-source">From <u>
            <u>A Greek-English Lexicon</u>
        </u> (Henry George Liddell, Robert Scott, Oxford, Clarendon Press, 1940) </div>
